<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market idle, no sales - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market idle, no sales - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said.</p>
<p>Inquiry and demand was light. Sales confirmed for the week to date including late Friday and the weekend on 900 head, mostly previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Confirmed - none   last week - none    last year -  1,900</p>
<p>Wk to date - 900   last week - 8,000   last year - 47,700</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
</text>
